     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Since the Society for Research on Educational Effectiveness conference was cancelled, and there is now no $ cost, please feel free to attend or\r\nshare with others who might find this of interest. <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b>What:</b>\r\nWorkshop: What would it take to Change your Inference? Quantifying the\r\nDiscourse about Causal Inferences in the Social Sciences<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b>When:\r\n</b>Noon-4pm (eastern) on Wed March 11. Q&amp;A available throughout, and extension\r\nfrom 4pm.-5pm.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b>Where:</b>\r\n<a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/clicks.memberclicks-mail.net/ls/click?upn=Fqh5juu4mt8mQ-2Ff2BH2-2Bxg1VVJGeiR7LgoN0cf0AneQXAnA7YN6JGKPtyH5NB5Wuiada8O3VD3iXIk-2Bm-2Fa7VEYykE3CO-2FCgznX1JBackTE-2F1ho-2F6x9vTFuKEby3fH-2F-2Fmyi4a_Vhj2cCRnm6oZIsNjJN9jSU26oc62pA5anG-2F0hoZtqYqVmdWJS4eF3iVxOFgBAj-2FjWaYk4rYdkfUYeKvSXiG5b51BFYOxd-2FKtYV8izSd84z6k0ipKzMNRO6sPHGPCowigWC-2FIOi4ggNip7Fp-2BpBCDN1xvOBxcP0P5MKBbCCfJElLSZ8mrO6wGS2U2m8a7URXx4Pa2Omg3ATbzpgEt22E2EVeZceNXsE4njXGxR9YoxRTKz4y2U8hOO0yAcL1TOaPkzbIpxUZicqBu91VmerzGhaUxAW-2FNrV6-2Fr2aZ4CSMkuR7ekYbvLDri-2F5APkXqRucuWEJT6qQFavSGB-2BDK-2B6OKzg-3D-3D__;!!HXCxUKc!m4pbNox7qgKAXhmG_97CaDluPRh4x4xBbFzT5ff5Y6oD1zDOHhIgHfEmPwztqms$\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/clicks.memberclicks-mail.net/ls/click?upn%3DFqh5juu4mt8mQ-2Ff2BH2-2Bxg1VVJGeiR7LgoN0cf0AneQXAnA7YN6JGKPtyH5NB5Wuiada8O3VD3iXIk-2Bm-2Fa7VEYykE3CO-2FCgznX1JBackTE-2F1ho-2F6x9vTFuKEby3fH-2F-2Fmyi4a_Vhj2cCRnm6oZIsNjJN9jSU26oc62pA5anG-2F0hoZtqYqVmdWJS4eF3iVxOFgBAj-2FjWaYk4rYdkfUYeKvSXiG5b51BFYOxd-2FKtYV8izSd84z6k0ipKzMNRO6sPHGPCowigWC-2FIOi4ggNip7Fp-2BpBCDN1xvOBxcP0P5MKBbCCfJElLSZ8mrO6wGS2U2m8a7URXx4Pa2Omg3ATbzpgEt22E2EVeZceNXsE4njXGxR9YoxRTKz4y2U8hOO0yAcL1TOaPkzbIpxUZicqBu91VmerzGhaUxAW-2FNrV6-2Fr2aZ4CSMkuR7ekYbvLDri-2F5APkXqRucuWEJT6qQFavSGB-2BDK-2B6OKzg-3D-3D__;!!HXCxUKc!m4pbNox7qgKAXhmG_97CaDluPRh4x4xBbFzT5ff5Y6oD1zDOHhIgHfEmPwztqms$&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244512948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RX0-UsHxJQX7-fTqPSdhd\">https://msu.zoom.us/j/783760435</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b>Materials:</b>\r\n<span style=\"color:#0070c0\"><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Quick%20Examples%20of%20Quantifying%20the%20Robustness%20to%20Invalidate.pptx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Quick%2520Examples%2520of%2520Quantifying%2520the%2520Robustness%2520to%2520Invalidate.pptx&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244512948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jez2teFYg56bOurNM50U0\"><span style=\"color:#0070c0\">quick examples</span></a></span><span style=\"color:#308298\"> </span>and\r\n<a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/clicks.memberclicks-mail.net/ls/click?upn=Fqh5juu4mt8mQ-2Ff2BH2-2Bxg1VVJGeiR7LgoN0cf0AneQXAnA7YN6JGKPtyH5NB5Wuiada8O3VD3iXIk-2Bm-2Fa7VEYykE3CO-2FCgznX1JBackTE-2BVFuEz3lq2DN8-2BRs4Vk1OO90nj_Vhj2cCRnm6oZIsNjJN9jSU26oc62pA5anG-2F0hoZtqYqVmdWJS4eF3iVxOFgBAj-2FjWaYk4rYdkfUYeKvSXiG5b51BFYOxd-2FKtYV8izSd84z6k0ipKzMNRO6sPHGPCowigWC-2FIOi4ggNip7Fp-2BpBCDN1xvOBxcP0P5MKBbCCfJElIcKzoy6y-2BSGt3HvYx-2FBBF98-2Bt3h9yF6OPXHtE4CmzHh51iDRwA-2BRfGezjeHhu9bGs9oBRoa1RZ3nYXhcBiEPYeHoIbwlTBuCvqimw5lOrmjGT5BFJm3DhmyohKr5ui4PKpcPM5wVPvs00WJji4Ojeu2sWTQKNDu9C-2BfEuFJcUE2g-3D-3D__;!!HXCxUKc!m4pbNox7qgKAXhmG_97CaDluPRh4x4xBbFzT5ff5Y6oD1zDOHhIgHfEmsbIXCoI$\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/clicks.memberclicks-mail.net/ls/click?upn%3DFqh5juu4mt8mQ-2Ff2BH2-2Bxg1VVJGeiR7LgoN0cf0AneQXAnA7YN6JGKPtyH5NB5Wuiada8O3VD3iXIk-2Bm-2Fa7VEYykE3CO-2FCgznX1JBackTE-2BVFuEz3lq2DN8-2BRs4Vk1OO90nj_Vhj2cCRnm6oZIsNjJN9jSU26oc62pA5anG-2F0hoZtqYqVmdWJS4eF3iVxOFgBAj-2FjWaYk4rYdkfUYeKvSXiG5b51BFYOxd-2FKtYV8izSd84z6k0ipKzMNRO6sPHGPCowigWC-2FIOi4ggNip7Fp-2BpBCDN1xvOBxcP0P5MKBbCCfJElIcKzoy6y-2BSGt3HvYx-2FBBF98-2Bt3h9yF6OPXHtE4CmzHh51iDRwA-2BRfGezjeHhu9bGs9oBRoa1RZ3nYXhcBiEPYeHoIbwlTBuCvqimw5lOrmjGT5BFJm3DhmyohKr5ui4PKpcPM5wVPvs00WJji4Ojeu2sWTQKNDu9C-2BfEuFJcUE2g-3D-3D__;!!HXCxUKc!m4pbNox7qgKAXhmG_97CaDluPRh4x4xBbFzT5ff5Y6oD1zDOHhIgHfEmsbIXCoI$&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244512948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eYzh7vLwMSFGwSBB9ckAM\">powerpoint for\r\ncombined frameworks</a> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Details:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;text-align:center;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:#333333\">What\r\nwould it take to Change your Inference? Quantifying the Discourse about Causal\r\nInferences in the Social Sciences</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Motivation</span></em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#333333\"><br>\r\nStatistical inferences are often challenged because of uncontrolled bias. There\r\nmay be bias due to uncontrolled confounding variables or non-random selection\r\ninto a sample. We will answer the question about what it would take to change\r\nan inference by formalizing the sources of bias and quantifying the discourse\r\nabout causal inferences in terms of those sources. For example, we will\r\ntransform challenges such as “But the inference of a treatment effect might not\r\nbe valid because of pre-existing differences between the treatment groups” to\r\nquestions such as “How much bias must there have been due to uncontrolled\r\npre-existing differences to make the inference invalid?” “QQQ% of the cases\r\nwould have to be replaced with cases with no treatment effect to change the\r\ninference.”</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;box-sizing:border-box\"><em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Approaches</span></em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#333333\"><br>\r\nIn part I we will use Rubin’s causal model to interpret how much bias there\r\nmust be to invalidate an inference in terms of replacing observed cases with\r\ncounterfactual cases or cases from an unsampled population. In part II, we will\r\nquantify the robustness of causal inferences in terms of correlations\r\nassociated with unobserved variables or in unsampled populations. Calculations\r\nfor bivariate and multivariate analysis will be presented using an app: <a href=\"https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=http-3A__konfound-2Dit.com_&amp;d=DwMFAg&amp;c=nE__W8dFE-shTxStwXtp0A&amp;r=F4oW3nXJKTAziDLTsgnr9A&amp;m=tTgkUiXmiyzMSaXbIOq7Nc2xdpoXFG_tKfFuV3XYn2o&amp;s=vnvqy6IPjT-knVFXpuAZYm5IiApvS861BcbiLp3DgKA&amp;e=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u%3Dhttp-3A__konfound-2Dit.com_%26d%3DDwMFAg%26c%3DnE__W8dFE-shTxStwXtp0A%26r%3DF4oW3nXJKTAziDLTsgnr9A%26m%3DtTgkUiXmiyzMSaXbIOq7Nc2xdpoXFG_tKfFuV3XYn2o%26s%3Dvnvqy6IPjT-knVFXpuAZYm5IiApvS861BcbiLp3DgKA%26e%3D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244512948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12OCBIqwSLOuGcAVY8D-2s\"><span style=\"color:#337ab7\">http://konfound-it.com</span></a> as\r\nwell as macros in STATA and R and a spreadsheet for calculating indices\r\n[KonFound-it!].</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;box-sizing:border-box\"><em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">Format</span></em><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#333333\"><br>\r\nThe format will be a mixture of presentation, individual exploration, and group\r\nwork. Participants may include graduate students and professors, although all must\r\nbe comfortable with basic regression and multiple regression. Participants\r\nshould bring their own laptop, or be willing to work with another student who\r\nhas a laptop. Participants may choose to bring to the course an example of an\r\ninference from a published study or their own work, as well as data analyses\r\nthey are currently conducting.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> Ken<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">Check out the R Shiny app for sensitivity analysis<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1155cd\"><a href=\"http://konfound-it.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://konfound-it.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244512948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2URNphjyIg6tUNqAuy8R90\">http://konfound-it.com</a></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\">.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Konfound%20it%20R%20shiny%20announce.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://msu.edu/~kenfrank/Konfound%2520it%2520R%2520shiny%2520announce.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244512948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0uSd-YPugOjPqtHU3nSs-P\"><span style=\"color:#006699\">R Shiny app KonFound-it</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Our\r\napproach to school governance: <a href=\"https://www.balancingvoices.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.balancingvoices.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244512948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15zI5C5lva3AEPvnY2JDBt\">https://www.balancingvoices.org/</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">Ken Frank<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">MSU Foundation Professor of Sociometrics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">Measurement and Quantitative Methods<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">Counseling, Educational Psychology and Special Education<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">Room 462 Erickson Hall<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">620 Farm Lane <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">Michigan State University<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\">East Lansing, MI 48824-1034 phone: <a href=\"tel:(517)%20355-9567\" value=\"+15173559567\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">517-355-9567</a> fax: <a href=\"tel:(517)%20353-6393\" value=\"+15173536393\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">517-353-6393</a>\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kenf...@msu.edu</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#1f497d\"><a href=\"https://www.msu.edu/user/k/e/kenfrank/web/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.msu.edu/user/k/e/kenfrank/web/index.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244512948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ScCbMhIx6L32j99iGkebw\">https://www.msu.edu/user/k/e/kenfrank/web/index.htm</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">pronouns\r\nhe/him/his<u></u><u></u></span></p></div>"
