   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Dr. Frank,<div>Thank you so much for your generous offer of the workshop online!</div><div>I am a new assistant professor in applied psychology and have been learning the powerful KonFound-it app as well as the methods associated with it. It has been mind-opening. I registered for the workshop but got dragged out to a department meeting about the coronavirus response... It kills me to miss such a great opportunity as I was already dismayed to miss the SREE conference...</div><div>I was wondering if you could please share with me the recording of the workshop if available? My email is <b><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zhan...@umn.edu</a></b>. I will keep it solely for my training purpose to protect your IP right.</div><div>Thank you so much for your help and support! May you have a wonderful weekend ahead!</div><div>Yanchen Zhang, PhD. NCSP.</div></div>"
    ],
