     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Tuesday, March 10, 2020 at 8:29:39 AM UTC-6, Ken Frank wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Since the Society for Research on Educational Effectiveness conference was cancelled, and there is now no $ cost, please feel free to attend or\r\nshare with others who might find this of interest. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b>What:</b>\r\nWorkshop: What would it take to Change your Inference? Quantifying the\r\nDiscourse about Causal Inferences in the Social Sciences</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b>When:\r\n</b>Noon-4pm (eastern) on Wed March 11. Q&amp;A available throughout, and extension\r\nfrom 4pm.-5pm.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b>Where:</b>\r\n<a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/clicks.memberclicks-mail.net/ls/click?upn=Fqh5juu4mt8mQ-2Ff2BH2-2Bxg1VVJGeiR7LgoN0cf0AneQXAnA7YN6JGKPtyH5NB5Wuiada8O3VD3iXIk-2Bm-2Fa7VEYykE3CO-2FCgznX1JBackTE-2F1ho-2F6x9vTFuKEby3fH-2F-2Fmyi4a_Vhj2cCRnm6oZIsNjJN9jSU26oc62pA5anG-2F0hoZtqYqVmdWJS4eF3iVxOFgBAj-2FjWaYk4rYdkfUYeKvSXiG5b51BFYOxd-2FKtYV8izSd84z6k0ipKzMNRO6sPHGPCowigWC-2FIOi4ggNip7Fp-2BpBCDN1xvOBxcP0P5MKBbCCfJElLSZ8mrO6wGS2U2m8a7URXx4Pa2Omg3ATbzpgEt22E2EVeZceNXsE4njXGxR9YoxRTKz4y2U8hOO0yAcL1TOaPkzbIpxUZicqBu91VmerzGhaUxAW-2FNrV6-2Fr2aZ4CSMkuR7ekYbvLDri-2F5APkXqRucuWEJT6qQFavSGB-2BDK-2B6OKzg-3D-3D__;!!HXCxUKc!m4pbNox7qgKAXhmG_97CaDluPRh4x4xBbFzT5ff5Y6oD1zDOHhIgHf